# 📑 Study Roadmap

## Part 1 — Network Fundamentals (20%)

Learn:

- Routers
- Layer 2 Switching
- Layer 3 Switching
- Firewalls
- Wireless Access Points
- Controllers
- End Devices
- Servers
- Power over Ethernet (PoE)
- Network Topologies
- Cabling
- TCP vs UDP
- IPv4
- IPv6
- Wireless Networking
- Virtualization
- Switching Concepts

---

## Part 2 — Network Access (20%)

Learn:

- VLANs
- Trunking
- Inter-VLAN Routing
- EtherChannel
- CDP
- LLDP
- Rapid PVST+
- Wireless Architectures
- Device Management

---

## Part 3 — IP Connectivity (25%)

Learn:

- Routing Tables
- Static Routes
- Floating Static Routes
- OSPF
- Administrative Distance
- Longest Prefix Match
- First Hop Redundancy Protocols

---

## Part 4 — IP Services (10%)

Learn:

- NAT
- DHCP
- DNS
- NTP
- Syslog
- SNMP
- QoS
- SSH
- FTP
- TFTP

---

## Part 5 — Security Fundamentals (15%)

Learn:

- Security Concepts
- AAA
- VPNs
- ACLs
- Port Security
- DHCP Snooping
- Dynamic ARP Inspection
- WPA2
- WPA3

---

## Part 6 — Automation & Programmability (10%)

Learn:

- Software Defined Networking (SDN)
- Controller-Based Networking
- REST APIs
- JSON
- Ansible
- Terraform
- AI in Networking
- Machine Learning

